{'symbol': 'SWK', 'date': '2021-09-14 13:07:00', 'title': 'BUILDING THE TRADE WORKFORCE OF THE FUTURE: STANLEY BLACK & DECKER LAUNCHES 5-YEAR, $25 MILLION COMMITMENT TO TRAIN MORE THAN 3 MILLION SKILLED TRADE WORKERS', 'text': 'BEGINNING OCT. 1, NONPROFITS CAN APPLY FOR EMPOWER MAKERS GLOBAL IMPACT CHALLENGE GRANTS TO ADVANCE AND ACCELERATE VOCATIONAL SKILLS TRAINING PROGRAMS PROGRAM AIMS TO FUEL THE GROWTH OF TRADE CAREERS AS MILLIONS OF JOBS GO UNFILLED, EXACERBATED BY THE PANDEMIC NEW BRITAIN, CONN., SEPT. 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- STANLEY BLACK & DECKER (NYSE: SWK) ANNOUNCED TODAY IT IS LAUNCHING A 5-YEAR, UP TO $25 MILLION COMMITMENT TO FUND VOCATIONAL SKILLS TRAINING AND RESKILLING PROGRAMS IN THE CONSTRUCTION AND MANUFACTURING SECTORS.'}